      "name": "ajevt_browser",
      "description": "Fast browser reflex for clear, bounded tasks with observable completion. Uses agent-browser as the only browser backend and Jev only for finite choices. Returns structured handoff instead of guessing. Do not use for exploratory research or complex reasoning. If a handoff may need a follow-up (input_required, ambiguous, needs_confirmation, or likely_done), set keep_session=true on the first call. Pass the returned session_id and current handoff URL to the next call; omit keep_session on the final call to close it. If no follow-up is needed, close a retained session with agent-browser --session <session_id> close. Without keep_session, the page closes and a retry starts over.",
